        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>C.</b>
			aor. 1
			
				Med.
			 in causal sense, <i>set up</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς θύρας</span>”
